11
01:01:52,500 --> 01:01:58,500
Class Action Park is a 2020 documentary film about the American amusement park Action Park, which was located in Vernon Township, New Jersey and was
known for the popularity it had among locals, and is infamous for the poor safety record of the attractions located on its grounds.

12
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
The title is based on one of the popular nicknames by parkgoers,
alongside "Traction Park" and "Accident Park".

13
01:13:07,500 --> 01:13:13,500
The film premiered virtually at the 2020 Florida Film
Festival and was released a week later on HBO Max.

14
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
It premiered on TNT on December 27, 2021.

15
01:24:22,500 --> 01:24:28,500
The film explores themes of fraud, accidental death, amusement park, injury.
